sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Host as Gateway host<br/>(DB allowlist)
    participant Sensor as Sensor<br/>(SessionManager)
    participant LoRa as LoRa (host-owned)
    participant Gateway as Gateway<br/>(SessionManager)
    participant SE_S as SecureElement<br/>(trait, sensor)
    participant SE_G as SecureElement<br/>(trait, gateway)

    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Non-blocking install (factory attestation + ECDSA + ECDH)
    Note over Sensor,Gateway: factory_pubkey cached on SessionManager at construction
    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Gateway discovery MANDATORY — start_install(INSTALL_DISCOVERY_DEST)

    Note over Sensor: start_install(INSTALL_DISCOVERY_DEST, &mut se, &mut rng)
    Note over Sensor: Host TX must be broadcast / discovery (not unicast)

    Sensor->>SE_S: get_static_pubkey() / get_factory_cert()
    Sensor->>SE_S: sign_ecdsa(frame_type ‖ sensor_mac ‖ pubkey ‖ nonce)
    Sensor->>LoRa: Transmit InstallRequest (discovery)<br/>{sender=sensor_mac, frame_type=0x01,<br/>sensor_pub[33], factory_cert[64],<br/>sensor_nonce[16], sensor_sig[64]}

    LoRa->>Gateway: process_incoming_packet → InstallRequest event
    Gateway-->>Host: SigilEvent::InstallRequest { peer=sensor_mac, frame }
    Host->>Host: DB allowlist check for peer MAC
    alt MAC not allowed
        Host-->>Host: drop / ignore
    else MAC allowed
        Note over Gateway: handle_install_request(frame, &mut se, &mut rng, now, key_lifetime_secs)
        Gateway->>SE_G: verify_ecdsa(factory_pubkey, sensor_pub, factory_cert)
        alt Invalid factory certificate
            Gateway-->>Gateway: Err(VerificationFailed) — no pending
        end
        Gateway->>SE_G: verify_ecdsa(sensor_pub, signed, sensor_sig)
        alt Invalid sensor signature
            Gateway-->>Gateway: Err(VerificationFailed) — no pending
        end
        Gateway->>SE_G: ecdh(sensor_static_pub) → shared_secret
        Gateway->>Gateway: derive_session_key(shared, sigil-install ‖ nonces)
        Gateway->>SE_G: get_static_pubkey() / get_factory_cert() / sign_ecdsa(...)
        Gateway->>LoRa: Transmit InstallChallenge<br/>{sender=gw_mac, frame_type=0x02,<br/>gw_pub[33], factory_cert[64],<br/>gw_nonce[16], key_lifetime_secs[4], gw_sig[64]}
    end

    Note over Sensor: continue_install(challenge) — rebind pending<br/>INSTALL_DISCOVERY_DEST → real gateway_mac

    LoRa->>Sensor: InstallChallenge
    Sensor->>Sensor: rebind_sole_sensor_install_pending(gateway_mac)
    Sensor->>SE_S: verify_ecdsa(factory_pubkey, gw_pub, factory_cert)
    alt Invalid gateway factory certificate
        Sensor-->>Sensor: Err(VerificationFailed)
    end
    Sensor->>SE_S: verify_ecdsa(gw_pub, signed, gw_sig)
    alt Invalid gateway signature
        Sensor-->>Sensor: Err(VerificationFailed)
    end
    Sensor->>SE_S: ecdh(gw_static_pub) → same shared_secret
    Sensor->>Sensor: derive_session_key(shared, sigil-install ‖ nonces)
    Sensor->>Sensor: install session (key, prefix, counters=0)
    Sensor->>SE_S: sign_ecdsa(gw_nonce)
    Sensor->>LoRa: Transmit InstallConfirm<br/>{peer_mac, frame_type=0x03, confirm_sig[64]}

    Note over Gateway: continue_install(confirm, &mut se, now)

    LoRa->>Gateway: InstallConfirm
    Gateway->>SE_G: verify_ecdsa(sensor_pub, gw_nonce, confirm_sig)
    Gateway->>Gateway: install stashed session (key, prefix, counters=0)
    Gateway-->>Host: PersistPeerStaticKey { peer, sensor_pub, resume_psk }

    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Both peers now share an active session.<br/>Host persists sensor static pubkey to NVRAM.
